以及他饰演布朗先生的经历。

7
00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:20.580
Yeah.
没错。

8
00:00:21.080 --> 00:00:25.380
Larry was our very first writer from the show as a guest on our podcaSt.
拉里是我们播客节目中邀请到的第一位来自该剧的编剧嘉宾。

9
00:00:25.380 --> 00:00:25.900
I know.
我知道。

10
00:00:26.020 --> 00:00:26.520
I love that.
我喜欢这一点。

11
00:00:26.740 --> 00:00:29.240
Well, Jenna, are you ready for some fun new tidbits?
那么，珍娜，你准备好听一些有趣的新花絮了吗？

12
00:00:29.440 --> 00:00:29.680
Yes.
准备好了。

13
00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:33.840
Performance Review has a fan favorite cold open.
《绩效评估》有一个粉丝最爱的开场戏。

14
00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:39.240
It's when Dwight has decided to ditch having a desk chair, and instead he gets a fitness thingy.
就是德怀特决定不再用办公椅，而是换成了一个健身器材。

15
00:00:39.640 --> 00:00:39.940
Yeah.
没错。

16
00:00:40.120 --> 00:00:40.240
Yeah.
是啊。

17
00:00:40.380 --> 00:00:41.080
The ball thing.
那个球状的东西。

18
00:00:41.240 --> 00:00:42.120
What do you call it?
你管它叫什么？

19
00:00:42.360 --> 00:00:43.320
The ball thing?
那个球状的东西？

20
00:00:43.700 --> 00:00:47.300
I mean, it's like a, what's that thing, a medicine ball?
我是说，它就像个……那叫什么来着，药球？

21
00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:49.720
But no, medicine balls are the small, heavy ones.
不对，药球是那种又小又沉的球。

22
00:00:49.720 --> 00:00:50.280
They're heavy ones.
它们很沉。

23
00:00:50.460 --> 00:00:51.520
I don't know what I call it.
我也不知道我管它叫什么。

24
00:00:51.660 --> 00:00:55.720
Well, I think the writers were trying to figure out what to call it as well because I found
嗯，我想编剧们当时也在琢磨该怎么称呼它，因为我找到了

25
00:00:55.720 --> 00:00:57.120
candy bag alts for it.
它的备选台词。

26
00:00:57.260 --> 00:00:57.440
Oh.
哦。

27
00:00:57.440 --> 00:01:00.640
In the shooting draft, Jim had this little bit of extra dialogue.
在拍摄剧本里，吉姆有一段额外的台词。

28
00:01:00.880 --> 00:01:04.480
He would look at Dwight sitting on the ball thing, and then Dwight would look at him and
他看着坐在那个球上的德怀特，然后德怀特看着他并

29
00:01:04.480 --> 00:01:05.660
