问道：你知道这是什么吗？

30
00:01:05.940 --> 00:01:07.780
And Jim would say, it's a hippity hop.
吉姆会回答：这是个蹦蹦球。

31
00:01:08.140 --> 00:01:09.480
The good ones have handles.
好的那种是有把手的。

32
00:01:09.780 --> 00:01:13.360
And then they had a series of candy bag alts for what to call it.
然后他们有一系列关于怎么称呼它的备选台词。

33
00:01:13.540 --> 00:01:15.540
First, Dwight says, it's a fitness ball.
首先，德怀特说：这是个健身球。

34
00:01:15.740 --> 00:01:16.600
It changed my life.
它改变了我的生活。

35
00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:17.320
Fitness ball.
健身球。

36
00:01:17.460 --> 00:01:18.700
I think that's what I would call it.
我觉得那才是我会用的叫法。

37
00:01:18.820 --> 00:01:21.680
The next candy bag alt, Dwight says, it's a yoga orb.
下一个备选台词，德怀特说：这是个瑜伽球体。

38
00:01:21.880 --> 00:01:22.240
Oh.
哦。

39
00:01:22.240 --> 00:01:24.080
Now we're in the orb world.
现在我们进入球体世界了。

40
00:01:24.320 --> 00:01:24.580
Okay.
好吧。

41
00:01:24.900 --> 00:01:27.100
The next one, Dwight says, it's a fitness orb.
下一个，德怀特说：这是个健身球体。

42
00:01:27.400 --> 00:01:28.820
Isn't that the one we settled on?
那不就是我们最终定下来的那个吗？

43
00:01:28.920 --> 00:01:30.280
That's the one they settled on.
那就是他们最终定下来的那个。

44
00:01:30.400 --> 00:01:33.720
I did an internet search and could not find it being called an orb anywhere.
我在网上搜了一下，没发现哪儿管它叫“球体”。

45
00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:34.280
Oh.
哦。

46
00:01:34.460 --> 00:01:36.420
What was it called in your internet search?
你在网上搜的时候它叫什么？

47
00:01:36.680 --> 00:01:40.020
Exercise ball, balance ball, stability ball.
健身球、平衡球、稳定性球。

48
00:01:40.220 --> 00:01:40.900
A lot of balls.
全是球。

49
00:01:41.020 --> 00:01:42.200
A lot of balls, no orbs.
全是球，没有球体。

50
00:01:42.560 --> 00:01:43.460
That's what she said.
她就是这么说的。

51
00:01:43.560 --> 00:01:45.440
I think our writer's room was having some fun there.
我觉得我们的编剧室当时玩得很开心。

52
00:01:45.620 --> 00:01:46.440
Guess what else?
你猜还有什么？

53
00:01:46.580 --> 00:01:46.780
What?
什么？

54
00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:49.640
There was a DVD commentary for this episode.
这一集有DVD评论音轨。

55
00:01:49.800 --> 00:01:51.200
That we never talked about?
我们从来没提过的那种？

56
00:01:51.200 --> 00:01:51.740
Oh, no.
噢，天哪。

57
00:01:52.020 --> 00:01:57.080
It features Rainn Wilson, Oscar Nunez, Paul Lieberstein, Melora Hardin, Larry Wilmore,
参与录制的有雷恩·威尔森、奥斯卡·努内兹、保罗·里伯斯坦、梅洛拉·哈丁、拉里·威尔莫，

58
00:01:57.260 --> 00:01:58.580
Paul Feig, and me.
保罗·费格，还有我。

59
00:01:58.740 --> 00:02:02.900
You were on a commentary and you didn't even mention it?
你录了评论音轨居然提都没提？

60
00:02:02.960 --> 00:02:03.960
No, I didn't.
没，我没提。

61
00:02:04.520 --> 00:02:05.360
Oh, man.
噢，天哪。

62
00:02:05.560 --> 00:02:08.760
Well, it's got a ton of fun stuff, but I thought I'd share two things.
里面有很多有趣的内容，但我打算分享其中两点。

63
00:02:08.980 --> 00:02:09.300
Okay.
好啊。

64
00:02:09.540 --> 00:02:14.420
First of all, when we interviewed Larry for this episode, he shared about the index cards
首先，当我们为这一集采访拉里时，他提到了编剧室墙上的索引卡片，

65
00:02:14.420 --> 00:02:15.660
