And then Michael asks Ryan to go and look.
然后迈克尔让瑞安去看看。

94
00:03:18.920 --> 00:03:22.960
Then Ryan yells from outside the conference room in the bullpen, oh, hey, there's another
接着瑞安在会议室外的办公区大喊，噢，嘿，还有一张

