And here's what Michael says.
迈克尔是这么说的。

129
00:04:46.320 --> 00:04:47.500
Michael says, so.
迈克尔说，所以呢。

130
00:04:47.940 --> 00:04:50.860
And Oscar goes, Michael, I don't know what to say.
奥斯卡说，迈克尔，我不知道该说什么。

131
00:04:50.860 --> 00:04:52.760
