这真的很有趣。

227
00:08:12.400 --> 00:08:14.000
Oh, my gosh.
天哪。

228
00:08:15.920 --> 00:08:16.740
All right.
好吧。

229
00:08:16.980 --> 00:08:22.060
Finally, we need to wrap up this second drink with a Michael talking head from Deleted Scenes.
最后，我们需要用一段来自删减片段的迈克尔访谈来结束这第二杯酒。

