而那个人又是我。

247
00:08:57.980 --> 00:08:59.020
So ironic.
真是讽刺。

248
00:08:59.980 --> 00:09:00.940
You know what?
你知道吗？

249
00:09:02.260 --> 00:09:04.840
The heart is smarter than the brain.
心脏比大脑更聪明。

250
00:09:09.090 --> 00:09:10.650
Brain is so effing hot.
大脑真是性感得要命。

251
00:09:12.640 --> 00:09:13.140
Okay.
好的。

252
00:09:13.520 --> 00:09:18.360
I am pretty certain I was there when he did that talking head because I am having, like,
我很确定他录那个访谈时我在场，因为我感觉……

253
