a flood of memories come in of being around the monitor watching that and loving it so very much.
记忆如潮水般涌来，当时我守在监视器旁看着那一幕，真的太喜欢了。

254
00:09:25.460 --> 00:09:28.480
Oh, I'm so glad that exists somewhere now.
噢，真高兴现在还有留存。

255
00:09:28.740 --> 00:09:29.260
Isn't that so great?
是不是很棒？

256
00:09:29.480 --> 00:09:29.600
Yes.
是啊。

257
00:09:29.740 --> 00:09:31.560
But the brain is so effing hot.
但这大脑真是热得要命。

258
00:09:31.760 --> 00:09:32.400
So effing hot.
热得要命。

259
00:09:33.340 --> 00:09:35.540
Well, that was my second drink.
好吧，那是我的第二杯酒了。

260
00:09:35.840 --> 00:09:37.300
This is such a great episode.
这一集真是太棒了。

261
00:09:37.840 --> 00:09:39.740
