People in Texas say, Chunk It.
德州人就是说“扔掉它”。

294
00:10:51.790 --> 00:10:55.410
Here I was being, like, all self-conscious because you said, no, it's Chunk It.
我本来还挺不好意思的，因为你说不对，应该是“扔掉它”。

295
00:10:55.410 --> 00:11:00.070
Then I'm talking to my mom over the holidays, and we're talking about going through the garage,
结果假期我和我妈聊天，谈到要清理车库时，

296
