314
00:11:31.110 --> 00:11:31.930
Just Chunk It.
直接“Chunk It”就行。

315
00:11:33.290 --> 00:11:36.770
And I guess in St. Louis, they say, I'm going to lie on the table.
我想在圣路易斯，他们会说，我要躺在桌子上。

316
00:11:36.970 --> 00:11:37.210
No.
不。

317
00:11:38.150 --> 00:11:39.570
Lay out all your cards.
摊开你所有的牌。

