Michael is determined to read between the lines.
迈克尔执意要从字里行间寻找深意。

335
00:12:23.290 --> 00:12:29.430
Also in this episode, Pam and Jim pranked Dwight by convincing him that it is Friday instead
这一集中，帕姆和吉姆还捉弄了德怀特，让他以为今天是周五

